Output scene-discover.mp4
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Padding 24
Hide
Type "cd /repo/packages/mcp-buyer && alias agentpos-buyer='node bin/agentpos-buyer.js' && export NO_COLOR=" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "agentpos-buyer demo https://demo.agentposhq.com --dry-run"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 22s
